# Stress Dream: any creature is a legal target, one's own too. Bot1 targets its own Ornithopter (toughness 2): it dies to the
# 5 damage, and the look still follows. The top two are Ancestral Recall and Mox Jet; the Jet goes to hand and the Recall to the
# bottom, so the order of the pair does not matter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Stress Dream
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Ancestral Recall
Mox Jet
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x25

